      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "复习「听说读写综合练习」时，先了解题型，再按计划练习。",
       "alumno": "To review «integrated listening, speaking, reading and writing practice», first get to know the question type and then practise with a plan.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "做完练习后，分析错误原因比重复同一类题更有效。",
       "alumno": "After doing the exercises, analysing why you got something wrong is usually more useful than repeating the same type of exercise.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较几种办法时，可以先说明各自的优点和不足。",
       "alumno": "When comparing several options, you can first explain their advantages and disadvantages.",
       "literal": "",
